	(text_box "- See UVLO.asc for UVLO simulation in LTspice.\n- See OVLO.asc for OVLO simulation in LTspice.\n- See OCLO.asc for OCLO simulation in LTspice.\n- See EMI_FILTER.asc for EMI filter simulation in LTspice."
