	)
	(text_box "Provide reverse-polarity insertion protection and a resettable fuse to protect against continuous overcurrent conditions.\n\nThe 100 ms soft-start circuit limits inrush current to 2 A @ 26.4 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 13.97 48.26 0)
		(size 137.16 27.9399)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
